# TestApp UI composition (UI8Kit essence)

Same rules as YMAIL_SITE / BotApp templ-retag, adapted to Svelte.

## Zones

| Zone | Paths | Raw HTML |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **U** | `web/src/kit/**` | Allowed (atoms). Prefer codegen later; hand-thin ok for VSA. |
| **L** | `web/index.html`, `App.svelte` phone chrome | Document / stage only |
| **C** | `web/src/views/**`, `web/src/components/**` | **No raw layout/typography/controls** — use kit |

## Block vs Box

- `Block` — one landmark root (`section` / `header` / `nav` / `article` / …). Always set `tag`.
- `Box` — inner non-landmark shells (`div` only).
- Do not use `Block` as a generic div wrapper.

## Atoms

`Stack`, `Group`, `Title`, `Text`, `Inline`, `Button`, `Input` from `$lib` → `../kit`.

## Allowlist

- `@html` only inside `MarkdownBody` after DOMPurify (`// retag:allow`).
- SVG icons inside dock/send may stay with a short allow comment until Icon brick lands.

## Chat UX

One composer, large primary actions, calm linear thread. No competing CTAs.
